# Line endings.
#
# This repository is edited from Windows and runs on Linux. A shell script that
# picks up CRLF fails on its very first line -- `set -euo pipefail\r` is read as
# an option named "pipefail\r" -- and the failure looks nothing like its cause.
#
# Normalise everything to LF in the repository, and check it out as LF too.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched, and never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.gz binary
*.sql.gz binary
